  "body": "From the moment you step inside 12D Gordon Avenue, the quality of craftsmanship is instantly clear. Designed for effortless living and sophisticated entertaining, the heart of this brand new home is its expansive open plan living area. This space transitions beautifully to a sun soaked outdoor deck, creating the perfect backdrop for summer barbecues.\r\n\r\nTwo storeys with a double internal access garage a rare luxury for new build. The layout prioritises spatial luxury and family convenience. With four bedrooms, two bathrooms, and an additional powder room, there is space for everyone. \r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance to Milford's best amenities and zoned for elite schools, this property represents a rare opportunity to secure a premium foothold in a tightly held location.\r\nIn zone for Milford School, Westlake Boys & Girls High Schools \r\n\r\nCCC and Title are issued ready to move in today.",
